{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Ability to cast a cantrip\n\nWell practiced in fundamental spellcasting, you learn two Warmage tricks from among the following:\n\nBlasting Cantrip, Corrosive Cantrip, Draining Cantrip, Explosive Cantrip, Icy Cantrip, Severe Cantrip, Silent Cantrip, and Static Cantrip. Your cantrips count as warmage cantrips for the purposes of these tricks, and your character level counts as your warmage level, where applicable.","level":1}],"id":"Custom4e11014b-fc0a-46f7-93d6-7f5b535e6f90","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Cantrip Specialist [VSS]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}